This licence covers the code in this repository with one exception: the five
OmniASR directories under `train/families/` vendor code derived from Meta's
`omnilingual-asr` (Apache License 2.0) and `fairseq2` (MIT License), both
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. Each of those directories
ships both upstream texts, as `UPSTREAM_LICENSE` and
`UPSTREAM_LICENSE.fairseq2`, and those terms govern that code. The vendored
files retain Meta's original header, whose reference to "the LICENSE file in
the root directory of this source tree" means the upstream projects' own
licence files, reproduced there.

Model weights are licensed separately, per repository, as recorded in the
Models table of README.md: the eight OmniASR models are Apache-2.0; the two
MMS models are CC-BY-NC-4.0, inherited from `facebook/mms-1b-all`.
